# .gcloudignore
# ignore everything by default
**
# include only what Cloud Build needs
!apps/
!apps/api/
!apps/api/**
!apps/worker/
!apps/worker/**
!cloudbuild.yaml
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.*
# Never upload credentials, whatever directory they sit in (these win over the re-includes above).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
# Ship the Docker ignore file so the image build applies the same exclusions.
!.dockerignore
